  "description": "The Syncfusion® DocumentChunking library is a .NET library that helps split large documents into smaller, meaningful chunks. These chunks make it easier to process, search, index, and use document content in AI-based applications.\n\n\tKey features:\n\t• Split Word documents by title, heading, section, paragraph, or table.\n\t• Split Excel workbooks by worksheet, table, subtable, range, or row group.\n\t• Split PDF documents by page, title, text block, paragraph, table, or OCR block.\n\t• Split PowerPoint presentations by slide, slide title, shape, notes, or table.\n\t• Split Markdown documents by heading, section, block, or block group.\n\t• Automatic mode detects the best splitting strategy for each document.\n\t• Produce detailed citations with page numbers, worksheet names, slide numbers, and heading paths.\n\t• Token-aware chunk sizing with a default token counter.\n\t• Group consecutive list paragraphs into single chunks.\n\t• Generate stable chunk identifiers for every produced chunk.\n\n\tLearn more: https://www.syncfusion.com/document-processing/document-chunking?utm_source=nuget&utm_medium=listing\n\n\tDocumentation: https://help.syncfusion.com/document-processing/document-chunking/overview?utm_source=nuget&utm_medium=listing\n\n\tSupport:\n\tIncident: https://www.syncfusion.com/support/directtrac/incidents/newincident?utm_source=nuget&utm_medium=listing\n\tForum:  https://www.syncfusion.com/forums?utm_source=nuget&utm_medium=listing\n\nThis is a commercial product and requires a paid license for possession or use. Syncfusion’s licensed software, including this component, is subject to the terms and conditions of Syncfusion's EULA (https://www.syncfusion.com/eula/es/?utm_source=nuget&utm_medium=listing). To acquire a license, you can purchase one at https://www.syncfusion.com/sales/products?utm_source=nuget&utm_medium=listing or start a free 30-day trial here (https://www.syncfusion.com/account/manage-trials/start-trials?utm_source=nuget&utm_medium=listing).",
